# /staticish/{gopher,gemini}/dreamstation.systems/ge/: OpenGET's retro frontends. NOT authored here —
# the openget daemon regenerates ~50 gophermaps/gemtext files under these after
# every stats recomputation, and `make install-retro` owns the cgi-bin/ scripts.
# Both dirs are openget:openget on disk. promoteSite.sh excludes them from its
# rsync and its chown for the same reason. See openget.txt.
/staticish/gopher/dreamstation.systems/ge/
/staticish/gemini/dreamstation.systems/ge/

# Written every 5 min by ntpstatsgen.timer, straight into the doc roots
# (same deal as /staticish/http/dreamstation.systems/ntpstats.txt above). See ntpstatsgen.txt.
/staticish/gopher/dreamstation.systems/ntpstats.txt
/staticish/gemini/dreamstation.systems/ntpstats.gmi

